description=Layer 1a+1b for build 48-5-1. Patched services.jar: DisplayManagerFlags.isExternalDisplayLimitModeEnabled()->false (cap removal) AND supportedReadyForModes rebuilt from mSupportedModes (every resolution at true max refresh). Removes the external-display resolution/refresh governor.
